WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.475
The Merlo-Davidson settlement exposed decades of systemic sexual harassment.

00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:08.562
Over 3,000 women came forward.

00:00:08.562 --> 00:00:10.962
Their careers were destroyed.

00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:15.475
The institution protected the perpetrators instead of the victims.
